# Credentials. The marketplace issues a consumer key and secret per API product,
# and a secret in a tracked file is a secret that has to be rotated. Keep them in
# the environment, or in .env, which is ignored here on purpose.
.env
.env.*
*.secret

# Downloaded feeds. Licensed data: it is not ours to redistribute (ADR-0005,
